1
00:00:00,160 --> 00:00:05,196
Every video starts with an idea. Open Narrate
helps you turn that idea into a story worth

2
00:00:05,196 --> 00:00:05,788
listening to.

3
00:00:06,367 --> 00:00:11,813
Start the Video Maker agent in Claude Code. Give
it a topic and tell it which language you want

4
00:00:11,813 --> 00:00:12,673
for the narration.

5
00:00:13,233 --> 00:00:17,753
Review the research and approve the script. Each
block connects a short passage of narration to

6
00:00:17,753 --> 00:00:19,166
the scene you will see.

7
00:00:19,733 --> 00:00:24,360
Review the main images and listen to a sample.
Chatterbox generates the voice, and Whisper

8
00:00:24,360 --> 00:00:26,210
checks each take against the script.

9
00:00:26,767 --> 00:00:31,686
Render the video and check the preview. If a
name sounds wrong, use the verification report

10
00:00:31,686 --> 00:00:34,146
to find and regenerate the right voice block.

11
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:39,969
This is the result. A short scene from our
pyramids demo, made with Open Narrate.
